// Training: CFG (return-conditioning, dropout ≥ 0.25) + CG classifier on raw rewards;
//          diffusion target = clamp(val/return_scale, ≥ 0)
// Inference per step:
// 1. $\mathrm{RTG}_t = \mathrm{clip}(\text{target\_return} - \sum r/\text{return\_scale},\, 0.05,\, 1.25\cdot\text{target\_return})$
// 2. spread $= 0.25\,\max(0.35, 1 - t/1000)$;  scale_grid $= \{1-\text{spread}, 1, 1+\text{spread}\}$
// 3. duplicate prior over scale_grid → candidate count varies per scale
// 4. condition = clip(RTG · scale, …);  call agent.sample with $w_{\mathrm{cfg}}, w_{\mathrm{cg}}$
// 5. score = classifier logp + 0.05·condition;  select top-4
// 6. weights = softmax(top4_scores / 2);  $a = \sum_k w_k\,a_k^{(0)}$  (elite-weighted action)

